WEBVTT

00:12.100 --> 00:14.610
Bear... Bear...

00:12.970 --> 00:14.610
Go!

00:15.280 --> 00:17.070
[Sword of Judgment]!

00:19.450 --> 00:20.590
[Flame]!

00:27.600 --> 00:29.440
Take that!

00:33.160 --> 00:35.530
Don't waste time on each one individually!

00:47.570 --> 00:49.630
Guess we should take care of these, too.

00:49.630 --> 00:51.510
No need for that.

00:51.510 --> 00:53.120
She's right.

00:57.030 --> 00:58.780
What are we gonna do now?

00:59.020 --> 01:01.640
Just stay airborne until the event ends?

01:01.640 --> 01:03.670
You know we can't do that.

01:03.670 --> 01:06.330
Those monsters can fly too, after all.

01:06.330 --> 01:08.850
They will attack us eventually.

01:08.850 --> 01:13.040
We need to find a place to stop 
and solidify our defense.

01:15.260 --> 01:17.370
We should hold out for a while here.

01:17.370 --> 01:20.840
Yeah, as long as we're here, we'll 
be able to handle whatever happens.

01:21.150 --> 01:25.180
The monsters are gonna close 
in on us soon enough, though.

01:27.100 --> 01:29.450
Look. The map's changed again.

01:29.720 --> 01:31.890
It's shrunk quite a bit now.

01:32.200 --> 01:36.140
The question is what kinds of monsters 
will show up when night falls.

01:36.140 --> 01:40.060
Yes. It would be ideal if we could 
hold out here until the end...

01:40.060 --> 01:44.040
It'll be fine! With all of us fighting 
together, I'm sure we can win!

01:44.040 --> 01:45.030
Yeah!

01:45.030 --> 01:49.090
When you say that, Maple, I feel 
like it really will happen.

01:49.090 --> 01:52.790
True. I suppose there's no 
sense in overthinking it.

01:52.790 --> 01:55.660
Then we'll just take things as they come.

01:55.660 --> 01:57.860
Let's make sure we all survive!

01:57.860 --> 02:01.140
Yeah! And if anything 
happens, I'll protect us!

02:01.140 --> 02:05.410
In that case, I'll set up some 
items around the perimeter.

02:05.410 --> 02:07.470
Okay, I'll guard you.

02:07.470 --> 02:09.100
I'll go, as well.

02:09.100 --> 02:11.940
If any monsters come, the 
three of us can take them.

02:11.940 --> 02:15.450
I'll set some traps on the other side, then.

02:15.450 --> 02:18.820
I'll go with you. I don't see 
any monsters yet, but...

02:18.820 --> 02:21.960
They could launch a surprise 
attack from anywhere.

02:21.960 --> 02:23.660
I'll join you, as well.

02:23.980 --> 02:24.890
Fay!

02:34.230 --> 02:36.130
I guess we finished in time.

02:36.670 --> 02:37.580
What's that?

02:41.750 --> 02:44.890
Sister, it appears it's begun.

02:44.890 --> 02:47.980
Yes. It's time for the stronger monsters.

02:47.980 --> 02:50.140
The final boss of the final day...

02:50.140 --> 02:51.940
What's it gonna be like?

02:51.940 --> 02:53.690
You think we'll be okay, bro?

02:54.150 --> 02:57.050
Well, ain't no point in 
fighting for no reason.

02:57.050 --> 02:59.270
All we gotta do is stay alive.

02:59.270 --> 03:03.940
Precisely! Let us bloom proudly 
and nobly until the end!

03:26.390 --> 03:30.930
<b>Maxing Defense </b>and <b>the Big Final Battle</b>.

03:30.930 --> 03:33.020
It's another fake Maple!

03:33.020 --> 03:36.350
Its size doesn't even compare 
to all the others, though.

03:36.350 --> 03:39.570
It must be fifty... no, 
a hundred meters tall.

03:44.910 --> 03:47.080
There's no way we can beat that!

03:47.080 --> 03:49.160
Just run! It's all we can do!

03:50.700 --> 03:54.170
We don't have to beat it! If we 
can just stay alive, we win!

03:54.170 --> 03:58.870
Leave the insane monsters to 
the insane monster players!

03:58.870 --> 04:01.630
Would even they go after that thing?!

04:01.630 --> 04:04.970
I-I'm not sure! They're 
pretty crazy themselves!

04:10.720 --> 04:12.050
Incoming! Above us!

04:23.110 --> 04:23.900
Maple!

04:23.900 --> 04:24.940
I'm on it!

04:26.870 --> 04:27.710
[Aegis]!

04:44.550 --> 04:46.220
Thank you, Maple.

04:46.220 --> 04:49.920
Sure. I dunno if I can save us 
if that keeps happening, though.

05:00.940 --> 05:03.650
Our medals!

05:04.740 --> 05:05.850
Let's go help them!

05:05.850 --> 05:08.370
They'll all be killed at this rate!

05:10.830 --> 05:14.160
You're right. This isn't 
like the guild competition.

05:14.160 --> 05:16.280
It's not as if helping them can hurt us.

05:16.280 --> 05:18.380
It's not a bad plan.

05:18.380 --> 05:20.540
The more players we still have alive,

05:20.540 --> 05:23.510
the more scattered the 
monster's attacks will be.

05:23.510 --> 05:27.710
If it's what our guildmaster 
wants, we have no objections.

05:27.710 --> 05:29.300
Right!

05:30.180 --> 05:31.350
O-Oh...

05:31.350 --> 05:32.890
Well, in that case...

05:32.890 --> 05:34.150
We have no choice!

05:34.480 --> 05:37.480
Let us bloom beautifully!

05:37.730 --> 05:40.270
Okay, so what should we do?

05:40.270 --> 05:42.950
Help those other players make a run for it?

05:44.400 --> 05:46.660
The field is still shrinking.

05:46.660 --> 05:50.740
By the end of the event, there'll 
probably be nowhere left to run.

05:50.740 --> 05:54.500
Which means we gotta do something 
about that big boy, huh?

05:54.500 --> 05:57.200
Yes, that one is our quarry.

05:57.200 --> 05:59.170
I guess it's our only choice.

05:59.430 --> 06:02.380
We need to bring down the other 
monsters' numbers first.

06:02.380 --> 06:05.420
We won't be able to focus 
on the big one otherwise.

06:05.420 --> 06:07.380
We should hurry, then.

06:07.380 --> 06:09.680
Flame Emperors, move out!

06:09.680 --> 06:11.010
Got it!

06:09.680 --> 06:11.010
Understood.

06:11.010 --> 06:13.600
Ignis! We'll head out first!

06:13.600 --> 06:14.720
Good luck, all!

06:15.420 --> 06:17.230
Order of the Holy Sword, we're going, too!

06:17.230 --> 06:19.440
Maple, we'll meet up later!

06:19.440 --> 06:20.190
Right!

06:25.650 --> 06:28.240
Sally, what should the rest of us do?

06:28.240 --> 06:32.410
With our speed, a hit-and-run 
wouldn't work too well.

06:32.410 --> 06:33.820
What we <i>can</i> do...

06:33.820 --> 06:36.660
is keep that big boss in one place.

06:38.040 --> 06:42.120
Yes. The others will get rid of 
the little ones in the meantime.

06:42.120 --> 06:46.840
We're all better suited to boss fights 
than just running around, anyway.

06:46.840 --> 06:48.470
Sounds good.

06:48.470 --> 06:52.180
We can beat that thing and 
take all the glory first.

06:52.180 --> 06:54.760
If just running from it won't work,

06:54.760 --> 06:57.930
we might as well lead an offensive, right?

06:57.930 --> 06:59.230
Don't forget us!

06:59.230 --> 07:00.320
We're in, too!

07:00.530 --> 07:02.060
You heard 'em, Maple.

07:02.060 --> 07:04.150
Yeah! Let's go!

07:07.110 --> 07:09.240
I can't! I'm done!

07:09.240 --> 07:11.910
And after we stayed alive this long!

07:23.670 --> 07:25.000
Turtle!

07:27.100 --> 07:28.510
It's Maple Tree!

07:28.510 --> 07:29.630
Thank God!

07:29.630 --> 07:31.300
Let's run while we can!

07:37.560 --> 07:39.480
We'll stick with the plan!

07:39.480 --> 07:41.190
Syrup, go down there!

07:42.980 --> 07:44.560
Turtle!

07:57.490 --> 08:00.590
From down here, it looks even bigger.

08:00.590 --> 08:03.170
Okay, let's get our plan into action.

08:03.170 --> 08:04.670
Kasumi, go for it!

08:04.670 --> 08:06.920
Right! Haku, let's go!

08:19.470 --> 08:22.730
I think that glowing spot is its weakness.

08:22.730 --> 08:25.100
Let's split up and whittle down its HP.

08:25.100 --> 08:28.690
Our goal is to keep all of 
us alive until the end.

08:28.690 --> 08:31.150
If things get too hairy, we fall back.

08:31.150 --> 08:32.320
Got it!

08:34.530 --> 08:35.700
[Atrocity]!

08:38.280 --> 08:40.290
Oboro! [Phantom World]!

08:43.120 --> 08:44.920
[Phantom World]!

08:54.130 --> 08:56.250
Maple, it's up to you!

08:56.250 --> 08:57.850
I'm on it!

08:58.220 --> 09:00.100
Okay, stick close!

09:00.100 --> 09:01.390
Go ahead!

09:16.860 --> 09:18.820
Keep after it!

09:26.670 --> 09:29.120
Whoa, close one!

09:29.120 --> 09:31.340
Okay, just like we planned!

09:31.340 --> 09:31.960
Yep!

09:31.340 --> 09:31.960
Right!

09:32.260 --> 09:33.300
Tsukimi!

09:33.300 --> 09:34.380
Bear!

09:34.380 --> 09:35.380
Yukimi!

09:35.380 --> 09:36.680
Bear!

09:36.680 --> 09:38.680
[Double Strike]!

09:37.890 --> 09:39.180
Bear!

09:41.640 --> 09:43.560
Necro! [Strong]!

09:44.310 --> 09:46.140
Leave our defense to me!

09:46.140 --> 09:48.520
It's not moving! Go for it!

09:48.520 --> 09:49.480
Right!

09:50.110 --> 09:51.610
[Double Impact]!

09:51.610 --> 09:52.860
Bear!

09:54.900 --> 09:56.450
[Multi-Cover]!

09:57.070 --> 09:58.910
[Heavy Body]!

09:59.370 --> 10:00.320
Kuromu!

10:00.320 --> 10:01.620
Don't worry about me!

10:01.990 --> 10:04.450
My regenerative power is no joke!

10:04.450 --> 10:06.290
I'll protect you as much as you need!

10:06.870 --> 10:08.330
Thank you!

10:20.390 --> 10:21.970
Okay, it's going as planned!

10:21.970 --> 10:23.260
Haku, go!

10:23.260 --> 10:25.140
Snake!

10:25.140 --> 10:26.420
[Arms of the Warrior]!

10:26.640 --> 10:28.820
[Fourth of Sword - Whirlwind]!

10:29.140 --> 10:30.560
[Quintuple Slash]!

10:30.560 --> 10:32.080
[Multi-Firebolt]!

10:35.480 --> 10:36.190
Sou!

10:49.200 --> 10:50.910
Good! It's working!

10:50.910 --> 10:54.000
Yeah, I doubt this is gonna 
be the end of it, though!

11:08.850 --> 11:10.180
I turned back!

11:10.180 --> 11:11.800
Elixir!

11:18.280 --> 11:19.350
Guys! Up there!

11:24.830 --> 11:26.620
[Flame Body]!

11:26.620 --> 11:28.120
[Guarding Light]!

11:35.630 --> 11:37.080
Thanks, Kanade!

11:37.080 --> 11:40.040
No worries. There's more 
where that came from.

11:47.720 --> 11:48.820
Are you okay?!

11:48.820 --> 11:50.310
Don't! Stay back!

11:50.760 --> 11:52.350
[Strong]! [Multi-Cover]!

11:52.350 --> 11:53.690
[Flame Body]!

11:53.690 --> 11:55.010
High Potion!

12:02.610 --> 12:05.280
Wonder if it's gonna heal 
up and then come back.

12:05.280 --> 12:07.170
Where are Maple and Sally?

12:07.870 --> 12:09.540
Still over there.

12:17.340 --> 12:18.130
Maple!

12:27.350 --> 12:28.680
[Web User]!

12:28.680 --> 12:30.220
Maple! You okay?

12:30.220 --> 12:31.350
Sally!

12:31.350 --> 12:35.700
Yeah! I figured it would go 
down if I attacked its wings!

12:35.700 --> 12:37.190
Good point...

12:37.730 --> 12:41.690
If we can knock it out of the sky, 
it won't be able to attack everyone.

12:42.650 --> 12:44.200
Let's go for it!

12:44.200 --> 12:44.780
Yeah!

12:47.990 --> 12:49.080
Sally!

12:54.950 --> 12:56.880
Thanks, Maple!

12:57.840 --> 13:00.340
I said I'd protect you, didn't I?

13:00.340 --> 13:02.180
You won't get away!

13:06.470 --> 13:07.590
[Web User]!

13:33.620 --> 13:35.130
[Web User]!

13:43.130 --> 13:45.260
We might really be in trouble now.

13:46.710 --> 13:48.130
[Cover Move]!

14:01.320 --> 14:03.070
Sally, you okay?

14:03.070 --> 14:06.450
I'm fine! What about you? Any damage?

14:06.450 --> 14:07.820
I'm still good, I think...

14:20.830 --> 14:22.420
Mii! Payne!

14:22.420 --> 14:23.920
I'm glad we got here in time!

14:25.870 --> 14:27.330
Everyone! Full-scale attack!

14:27.550 --> 14:28.800
Right!

14:30.790 --> 14:32.390
Notes! [Amplify]!

14:33.220 --> 14:34.640
[Multi-Firebolt]!

14:37.430 --> 14:39.730
Earth! [Earth Rage]!

14:41.060 --> 14:42.860
Shadow! [Shadow Nation]!

14:46.350 --> 14:47.820
[Holy Spear]!

14:49.740 --> 14:51.070
[Phalanx]!

14:53.440 --> 14:54.950
[Split-Sword]!

15:03.350 --> 15:05.170
Fay! [Entangling Grass]!

15:09.170 --> 15:10.840
[Double Impact]!

15:13.100 --> 15:14.350
[Arms of the Warrior]!

15:14.350 --> 15:16.640
[Last of Sword - Hazy Moon]!

15:21.360 --> 15:22.650
[Gravity Cage]!

15:27.990 --> 15:30.110
Necro! [Flames of Death]!

15:34.450 --> 15:36.740
[Magnificent Rose Rondo]!

15:37.870 --> 15:39.250
Let's go!

15:39.250 --> 15:40.910
Right, Sister!

15:40.910 --> 15:42.920
[Star Lily's Smile]!

15:43.880 --> 15:46.670
You might dodge our first attack...

15:46.670 --> 15:49.380
But you can't dodge our 
second and third strikes!

15:49.380 --> 15:50.800
We are the trinity!

15:50.800 --> 15:53.010
They call us the Blazing Brothers Trio!

15:53.010 --> 15:55.550
[Jet Stream]!

15:59.270 --> 16:01.390
Looks like everyone's safe.

16:01.390 --> 16:02.980
Yeah! Thank goodness!

16:02.980 --> 16:04.800
We mustn't fall behind!

16:04.800 --> 16:08.790
Yes! That thing still has a lot of HP!

16:08.790 --> 16:09.990
Syrup!

16:13.320 --> 16:15.120
[Deploy Armaments]!

16:20.370 --> 16:22.120
[Holy Dragon Light Blade]!

16:24.080 --> 16:26.040
[Karmic Fire of Carnage]!

16:31.260 --> 16:33.260
[Quintuple Slash]!

16:37.300 --> 16:38.680
[Commence Attack]!

16:38.680 --> 16:39.430
[Hydra]!

16:43.980 --> 16:46.110
Syrup! [Spirit Cannon]!

16:46.110 --> 16:47.560
Turtle!

16:55.910 --> 16:57.410
Turtle!

16:57.830 --> 16:58.660
Maple!

17:03.620 --> 17:05.040
My gauge is red...

17:05.040 --> 17:07.130
This might be bad.

17:07.130 --> 17:08.090
Maple!

17:17.180 --> 17:19.010
Just barely enough MP...

17:19.390 --> 17:21.060
[A Step Toward the Underworld]!

17:26.400 --> 17:28.940
Maple!

17:35.400 --> 17:37.140
Thanks, Sally!

17:37.140 --> 17:40.030
The rest is up to you, Guildmaster!

17:40.030 --> 17:41.790
Right! Now I can...

17:44.990 --> 17:46.540
What is she planning to do?

17:46.540 --> 17:47.750
I think it's...

17:47.750 --> 17:49.250
Back me up, Payne!

17:49.250 --> 17:50.090
Got it!

17:50.090 --> 17:51.880
Go, Maple!

17:51.880 --> 17:53.290
We're counting on you!

17:53.290 --> 17:55.220
If anyone can do it, it's you!

17:55.220 --> 17:57.760
Show 'em what it means to 
have maxed-out defense!

18:02.720 --> 18:05.350
Here I go!

18:06.690 --> 18:07.650
I knew it!

18:09.260 --> 18:10.640
Syrup, do it!

18:10.640 --> 18:12.230
Tur...

18:12.230 --> 18:14.690
...tle!

18:15.610 --> 18:17.280
[Devour]!

18:28.000 --> 18:29.120
Maple!

18:30.170 --> 18:31.460
Did that work?

18:31.460 --> 18:33.800
Nice one, Maple! Look!

18:47.090 --> 18:49.690
We did it!

18:49.690 --> 18:51.480
Maple!

18:52.130 --> 18:54.120
Guys! I'm so glad you're all safe!

19:04.200 --> 19:06.500
Sally! Medals! We got medals!

19:06.500 --> 19:07.830
Three of them!

19:08.660 --> 19:12.880
I feel like that was worth a little 
more than three, but great!

19:12.880 --> 19:15.200
And the event is over!

19:15.200 --> 19:17.800
Great job, everyone!

19:17.800 --> 19:22.180
All those who are still 
alive get five medals!

19:22.180 --> 19:24.300
If you get ten medals total,

19:24.300 --> 19:28.140
you can trade them for any 
skill or equipment you want!

19:28.430 --> 19:31.850
See you next time with 
the opening of Level 8!

19:31.850 --> 19:33.940
Bye now!

19:36.360 --> 19:38.910
This... This can't be...

19:38.910 --> 19:42.660
Code Alpha just went down 
like any old monster...

19:42.660 --> 19:44.580
I can't believe it.

19:44.580 --> 19:46.660
And it was worth three medals.

19:46.660 --> 19:49.870
And the surviving players 
get five medals each...

19:49.870 --> 19:51.710
which is a total of eight!

19:51.710 --> 19:54.380
We'll have to tweak Level 
8 before it goes live!

19:54.380 --> 19:59.800
The field design, the strength of the 
monsters, the floor boss mechanics...

20:00.220 --> 20:02.590
This is gonna destroy my schedule.

20:04.140 --> 20:06.140
Get a hold of yourselves!

20:06.140 --> 20:08.640
All the participants in the event are happy!

20:08.640 --> 20:11.390
All of your efforts came to fruition!

20:11.390 --> 20:12.310
Huh?!

20:12.310 --> 20:15.520
You should be grateful to be 
in your positions as admins!

20:15.520 --> 20:17.930
W-Well, yeah, we know, but...

20:17.930 --> 20:20.320
Wait, were you always so passionate?!

20:20.570 --> 20:22.240
The players' smiles!

20:22.240 --> 20:24.700
Are they not our greatest joy?!

20:24.700 --> 20:27.740
We will endure any hardship 
to make them a reality!

20:27.740 --> 20:30.160
Even if we are beaten and knocked down,

20:30.160 --> 20:31.790
we rise as many times as it takes!

20:32.330 --> 20:34.750
I... I...

20:34.750 --> 20:38.500
I have always admired all of 
you for working that way!

20:38.500 --> 20:39.920
Really?!

20:39.920 --> 20:41.880
Well, that sure is nice, but...

20:41.880 --> 20:44.970
Our physical and mental capacities 
still have their limits.

20:44.970 --> 20:47.260
This is the time to stand firm!

20:47.260 --> 20:49.640
Show me what makes you all so strong!

20:49.640 --> 20:52.480
Welcome all the overtime 
that comes your way!

20:52.480 --> 20:56.310
I'll negotiate with the top brass 
to increase your overtime pay!

20:56.310 --> 20:57.440
Really?!

20:57.440 --> 21:05.030
Secretary

20:57.820 --> 21:00.360
I'll ask them to give you 
a special bonus, too!

21:00.360 --> 21:05.030
NWO has become a massive 
hit because of all of you!

21:06.490 --> 21:09.580
I'll ask them to bring 
in more personnel, too!

21:09.580 --> 21:14.250
The young lady who works under 
me said she wanted to work here!

21:15.950 --> 21:18.500
I think you're all a little too excited...

21:18.500 --> 21:23.380
Though... well... I can't say whether 
the top brass will listen to me...

21:24.260 --> 21:27.640
We got a lot more medals than we expected!

21:27.640 --> 21:30.220
I wonder what I should 
exchange them for this time!

21:30.220 --> 21:33.420
I think we can wait until Level 8 comes out.

21:33.420 --> 21:37.340
We can decide after we see 
what kind of place it is.

21:38.690 --> 21:40.120
I get it!

21:40.120 --> 21:43.680
In that case, there's something 
I wanna do! Can we?

22:22.010 --> 22:24.270
Kinda brings back memories, doesn't it?

22:24.540 --> 22:29.400
It feels like it's been such a long 
time since we first came here.

22:30.270 --> 22:31.990
I'm glad you got so hooked.

22:32.870 --> 22:37.920
But I'm sure even stronger monsters 
and guilds will be coming along,

22:37.920 --> 22:39.200
so we can't get lazy!

22:39.200 --> 22:42.490
Yeah! I'll keep doing my best 
with maxed-out defense!

22:42.490 --> 22:44.160
I don't like getting hurt, after all.

22:44.160 --> 22:46.320
And I'll work even harder.

22:46.320 --> 22:48.750
I don't want a certain 
someone leaving me behind.

22:48.750 --> 22:51.170
Aw, I'll never leave you!

22:51.170 --> 22:53.090
Yeah, well, I know you...

22:52.890 --> 22:56.190
Look, it's Maple and Sally from Maple Tree!

22:53.090 --> 22:55.140
Hey! You didn't have to say that!

22:56.610 --> 22:59.890
They were incredible in that last event!

22:59.890 --> 23:03.440
Yes, but they are not undefeatable.

23:03.440 --> 23:07.690
I'm sure they've never fought 
anyone like us before.

23:07.690 --> 23:10.410
Man, I can't wait!

23:10.410 --> 23:12.810
I'm psyched to fight Sally, especially!

23:13.150 --> 23:14.520
Come on!

23:13.690 --> 23:14.950
Jeez...

23:16.130 --> 23:17.980
They certainly are full of energy.

23:17.980 --> 23:19.820
Well? Think we can beat them?

23:19.820 --> 23:23.350
Who knows? There's no 
telling until we try...

23:25.690 --> 23:28.460
